same forest on 30 000 fresh healthy readings: share with s > 0.5: 0.2753
score quantiles of the fresh healthy readings (s): 50% 0.461  90% 0.558  99% 0.662  99.9% 0.724  max 0.736
500 faults: median s 0.689  share above 0.5: 1.0  share above the 99.9% healthy limit 0.724 : 0.086
AUC healthy against faults: 0.9894
fault rate 0.001: with 12 % flagged the best precision is 0.0083; at 10 000 readings/day: 10 faults, 1200 flags
300 healthy readings: largest s 0.67  99.9% quantile estimate (=interpolated near the maximum) 0.67  against the 30 000 estimate 0.724
  share of fresh healthy readings above the largest of the 300: 0.0085

